-- Rich, index-worthy product descriptions.
-- Replaces one-sentence stubs (root cause of "Discovered – currently not
-- indexed" on all product pages in Google Search Console).
-- Apply: Supabase Dashboard → SQL Editor → paste → Run. Updates 7 rows.

update products set description = $$The Naji Gold Fur XL is the centerpiece of the Naji Collection — oversized, unapologetic, and impossible to ignore. Plush gold fur wraps a structured body finished with polished gold-tone hardware, so the bag catches light from every angle. The XL silhouette carries the full night-out load — phone, wallet, keys, and touch-up essentials — without losing its shape. This is the bag for evenings when subtle is not the assignment: galas, holiday parties, birthdays, and any entrance worth making. Handcrafted and designed in Dallas, because luxury should feel as good as it looks. Fierce by nature. Luxury by design.$$ where slug = 'naji-gold-fur-xl';

update products set description = $$The Naji Maroon Red Fur XL brings deep, wine-dark color to the Naji Collection — the same oversized fur silhouette, recast in a rich maroon-red that reads as well at a winter wedding as it does on a night out. Plush fur is finished with warm gold-tone hardware that sets off the deep red tone. The XL size swallows the essentials — phone, wallet, keys, and makeup — and still closes clean. Designed in Dallas and handcrafted for the moments that call for a statement. If the Naji is the exclamation point, the Maroon Red is the one in your favorite color.$$ where slug = 'naji-maroon-red-fur-xl';

update products set description = $$The Denim De Ville Blue Gold is street-luxury, Féroce style. Deep indigo denim is quilted with the signature F monogram and trimmed with gold-tone hardware, pairing everyday durability with evening polish. The gold chain strap shifts the bag from crossbody to shoulder in seconds, and the compact mini shape holds your phone, card holder, keys, and lipstick — everything a night out actually requires. Denim De Ville is the collection built for the city: tough enough for the day, sharp enough for dinner after. Designed in Dallas, where we take both seriously.$$ where slug = 'denim-de-ville-blue-gold';

update products set description = $$The Denim De Ville Cream Gold lightens the collection in the best way — soft cream denim quilted with the signature F monogram and set against warm gold-tone hardware. The effect is fresh, clean, and quietly expensive: the bag that works with white sneakers at brunch and heels at dinner. A gold chain strap converts it from crossbody to shoulder carry, and the mini silhouette keeps the essentials close without the bulk. Part of the Denim De Ville Collection, designed in Dallas for people who move through the city all day and still look composed at midnight.$$ where slug = 'denim-de-ville-cream-gold';

update products set description = $$The Féroce Fanny Pack in Black is luxury, hands-free. Smooth black construction is finished with gold-tone hardware and the structured silhouette that separates a FÉROCE belt bag from the floppy festival version — it sits clean against the body and keeps its shape. Wear it crossbody, at the waist, or over one shoulder. Sized for the true essentials — phone, card holder, keys, and lip balm — it is the bag for travel days, concerts, and anywhere a tote gets in the way. Fierce utility, designed in Dallas.$$ where slug = 'feroce-fanny-pack-black';

update products set description = $$The Féroce Fanny Pack in Grey trades black severity for something softer but no less sharp. A muted grey body sets off the gold-tone hardware and keeps the same sculpted, structured silhouette the FÉROCE belt bag is known for. Wear it at the waist, across the chest, or over the shoulder — it moves with you either way. It carries the essentials — phone, card holder, keys, and lip balm — without ever slowing you down. Built for travel, festivals, and long city days. Designed in Dallas. Fierce by nature.$$ where slug = 'feroce-fanny-pack-grey';

update products set description = $$The Féroce Satchel Bag is structured utility in its purest form. A crisp, architectural silhouette with a structured top handle and a shoulder strap, it moves from hand carry to shoulder without missing a beat. The interior is organized for a real day — phone, wallet, keys, and the small emergencies — and the structured body holds its shape whether it is full or not. Gold-tone hardware and clean lines finish the look. This is the everyday bag, elevated: the one you reach for Monday through Sunday. Handcrafted, designed in Dallas, and built for legacy.$$ where slug = 'feroce-satchel-bag';
